;;; Syntax probe — negation.
;;;
;;; Stored negation: over a binary fact, a unary one, a bare atom, and
;;; one carrying a `:source`.
;;;
;;; One of the eighteen node-kind fixtures. As corpus entries they are
;;; rendered under every parse view and every op, and each rendering is
;;; digested by `corpus_shapes.md5`, so a change to how any of these
;;; shapes is drawn moves a digest. They exist because no *puzzle*
;;; contains these shapes.

(not (r a b))
(not (u a))
(not plain)
(not (r a b) :source "(9)")
